    "views": {
      "09000300001502171326133265R": "2015 reverse view within campus. The two wings have large red-mullioned windows above grey plinths, red columns and a through passage. The center is open.",
      "09000300122101130916456057I": "2021 frontal street panorama. A single broad gate, green hip roof, narrower ridge, side perimeter walls and physically separate stone lamp posts. Three sets of door panels are closed in this view. The production mesh uses the open 2010/2015 condition."
    }
  },
  "estimates": [
    "Wall depth, roof pitch, height and exact column offsets are proportional estimates, without measured architectural drawings.",
    "Decorative beam motifs, green ridge animals and sculpted stone lions are original simplified geometry. The four vertical characters reproduce the reading in a licensed typeset subset rather than a digital tracing of the handwriting.",
    "The 797 building, campus walls, separate crossing, replacement lamp posts and other historic campus buildings retain their own map context."
